# Ignore caches and runtime logs
**/Cache/**
**/cache/**
**/*Cache*/**
**/*.log
**/logs/**

# Ignore Electron & Browser storage databases
**/Local Storage/**
**/Session Storage/**
**/IndexedDB/**
**/Shared Storage/**
**/Shared Dictionary/**
**/Crashpad/**
**/DawnGraphiteCache/**
**/DawnWebGPUCache/**
**/GPUCache/**
**/Code Cache/**

# Ignore heavy virtual machine / disk images & containers
winapps/windows/*.img
winapps/windows/*.base
winapps/windows/*.boot

# Ignore lockfiles and temporary sockets
**/*.lock
**/*.conf_changes.dat
**/Singleton*

# Ignore telemetry data
go/telemetry/
